# Jak II: the gun brought up to the eyes (LIST-0.1.1 items 20 and 24), run with JAKVR_TEST_GUN=1 JAKVR_BODY_TRACE=1 and
# C:\JakQuest\sim\gkcfg-hide (Hide arms near your eyes on). A new game to the fortress exit (as jak2_holster.sim), the
# gun drawn at the hip, then the right hand 12 cm before the eyes: the gun's hand does not pitch (the gun stays where
# the controller points), so its forearm comes near the eyes and, with the option on, is cut out of them: expect
# "[vr-body] the right arm cut out of the eyes", then "... back in the eyes" with the hand back at its rest. The left
# hand is brought up the same way at the end (no gun: it pitches, its forearm stays clear, no cut).
